---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, ORG, NAV_LINKS, FOOT_LINKS } from '../consts';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer>
	<div class="container foot-grid">
		<div class="foot-about">
			<a href="/" class="brand">
				<span class="brand-mark"><Icon name="wheat" size={24} /></span>
				<span>{SITE_TITLE}</span>
			</a>
			<p>
				Recurso independiente de información basada en evidencia sobre la enfermedad celíaca en
				Guatemala, e iniciativa de incidencia en política pública.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="foot-col">
			<h4>Navegación</h4>
			<ul>
				{NAV_LINKS.map((link) => <li><a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a></li>)}
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="foot-col">
			<h4>El proyecto</h4>
			<ul>
				{FOOT_LINKS.map((link) => <li><a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a></li>)}
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="foot-col foot-note">
			<h4>Aviso</h4>
			<p>
				El contenido tiene fines informativos y no sustituye la consulta médica. No mantenemos
				relación comercial con marcas ni establecimientos: los mencionamos solo como referencia.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="foot-bottom container">
		<span>&copy; {year} {ORG.name}. Un producto de <a href="https://cincois.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Cinco Innovative Solutions LLC</strong></a></span>
		<span>Hecho en Guatemala.</span>
	</div>
</footer>
<style>
	footer {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		background: rgb(var(--green-dark));
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
		padding-top: 3.5rem;
	}
	.foot-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr 1.3fr 1.3fr;
		gap: 2.5rem;
		padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}
	.brand {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: #fff;
		text-decoration: none;
		margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
	}
	.brand-mark {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 38px;
		height: 38px;
		border-radius: 11px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
		color: #fff;
	}
	.foot-about p {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		max-width: 34ch;
	}
	.foot-col h4 {
		color: #fff;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}
	.foot-col ul {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.foot-col li {
		margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
	}
	.foot-col a {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.foot-col a:hover {
		color: #fff;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
	.foot-note p {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin: 0;
		max-width: 36ch;
	}
	.foot-bottom {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
	}
	.foot-bottom a {
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.foot-bottom a:hover {
		color: #fff;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.foot-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.foot-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
